		{"id":"6225cffa2e228dc4","type":"text","text":"整数（integer） $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\text {正整数：如 }1,2,3,\\cdots\\\\ \\text {零：0}\\\\ \\text {负整数：如 }-1,-2,-3,\\cdots\\end{array}\\right.$ \n分数（fraction） $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\text {正分数：如 }\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{3},5.2,\\cdots\\\\ \\text {负分数：如 }-\\frac{1}{5},-3.5,-\\frac{5}{6},\\cdots\\end{array}\\right.$\n整数与分数统称[[有理数]]（rational number）。","x":-256,"y":940,"width":439,"height":163},
